01:06:22.330 --> 01:06:24.290
Well, we'll have to find the brown monster first.

01:06:26.590 --> 01:06:29.980
So strange how different...

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:42.480
They are one lives in the sea and the other one lives up in the mountains now. Where do we start? Hmm. It must be somewhere here

